// Figure vocabulary: every figure a creature may present, declared as
// an ordered id list. Load assigns each id a runtime handle in entry order;
// handles are unstable across loads (entry order decides them), so saved
// data must translate through the id mapping, never store raw handles.
// A figure id declared here is only a name — everything it needs to
// render (texture, grid, clips) lives in the appearance table.
[ "warrior" ]
